# VS Code REST Client: click "Send Request" above each block.
# Run `npm run dev` first. Switch @base to the Render URL to test the live API.

@base = http://localhost:4000
@brandEmail = brand-demo@example.com
@creatorEmail = creator-demo@example.com
@password = correct horse battery

### Health: 200 { ok: true }
GET {{base}}/health

### Sign up a brand: 201 (409 if you run it twice)
# @name brandSignup
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{brandEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "Acme CRM", "role": "brand" }

### Sign up a creator: 201
# @name creatorSignup
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{creatorEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "Dana Creator", "role": "creator" }

### Log in as the brand: 200 with a token
# @name brandLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{brandEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Log in as the creator: 200 with a token
# @name creatorLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{creatorEmail}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@brandToken = {{brandLogin.response.body.token}}
@creatorToken = {{creatorLogin.response.body.token}}

### Who am I (brand): 200 { user }
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### Who am I (creator): 200 { user, profile }
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

########## Creators ##########

### Creator saves their profile: 200 { creator } (the card brands see)
PUT {{base}}/creators/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "niche": "RevOps",
  "bio": "Ex-VP Sales. I write about pipeline hygiene and forecasting that holds up.",
  "audience": "SaaS founders and sales leaders, seed to Series B",
  "priceCents": 45000,
  "followers": 18400
}

### Marketplace: 200 { creators, niches }. No login needed
GET {{base}}/creators

### Filter and sort: niche, max price in cents (inclusive), sort=reliability|price|followers
GET {{base}}/creators?niche=RevOps&maxPriceCents=50000&sort=price

### One creator: 200 { creator }
GET {{base}}/creators/{{creatorLogin.response.body.user.id}}

########## Wallet ##########

### Brand tops up $1,000 (demo money): 200 { availableCents, heldCents, reconciled }
POST {{base}}/wallet/topup
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amountCents": 100000 }

### Wallet: reconciled=true means the balance matches the ledger
GET {{base}}/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### Ledger, newest first
GET {{base}}/wallet/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

########## Bookings (the escrow flow) ##########

### Brand books the creator: 201. The price moves from available to held
# @name book
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creatorId": "{{creatorLogin.response.body.user.id}}",
  "brief": "Post about our new pipeline analytics dashboard. Mention the free trial.",
  "destinationUrl": "https://acme.example/launch",
  "deadline": "2026-10-10T17:00:00Z"
}

@bookingId = {{book.response.body.booking.id}}

### Approve before anything is submitted: 409 (the refused step for the demo)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### Creator accepts: 200, and the booking now has a trackingUrl
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

### Creator submits the LinkedIn post: 200
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "postUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/dana_pipeline-activity-123" }

### Brand approves: 200. Held money is released and the creator is paid
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### The booking with its timeline (either party)
GET {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

### My bookings, optionally ?status=requested|accepted|submitted|paid|refunded
GET {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### Creator's wallet after payout
GET {{base}}/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

### Book again, then decline: the brand is refunded in full
# @name bookToDecline
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creatorId": "{{creatorLogin.response.body.user.id}}",
  "brief": "A second campaign brief that the creator will turn down.",
  "destinationUrl": "https://acme.example/second",
  "deadline": "2026-10-10T17:00:00Z"
}

### Creator declines: 200, refundReason=declined
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookToDecline.response.body.booking.id}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

########## Failure cases ##########

### Approving twice: 409 "already paid"
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}

### Creator tries to approve: 403
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}

### Post link that isn't LinkedIn: 400
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "postUrl": "https://linkedin.com.evil.example/post" }

### Deadline in the past: 400
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creatorId": "{{creatorLogin.response.body.user.id}}", "brief": "A brief that is long enough.", "destinationUrl": "https://acme.example", "deadline": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z" }

### Creator tries to top up: 403
POST {{base}}/wallet/topup
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amountCents": 1000 }

### Brand tries to save a creator profile: 403
PUT {{base}}/creators/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{brandToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "niche": "RevOps", "bio": "", "audience": "", "priceCents": 45000, "followers": 0 }

### Price sent as text: 400
PUT {{base}}/creators/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "niche": "RevOps", "bio": "", "audience": "", "priceCents": "450", "followers": 0 }

### Unknown niche filter: 400
GET {{base}}/creators?niche=Crypto

### Unknown creator id: 404
GET {{base}}/creators/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Malformed creator id: 404
GET {{base}}/creators/not-an-id

### Duplicate email, different case: 409
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "BRAND-DEMO@example.com", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "Again", "role": "brand" }

### Invalid role: 400
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "x@example.com", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "X", "role": "admin" }

### Short password: 400
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "y@example.com", "password": "short", "name": "Y", "role": "brand" }

### Malformed JSON: 400
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":

### Wrong password: 401 "Wrong email or password"
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{brandEmail}}", "password": "wrong password" }

### Unknown email: 401, identical message
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### No token: 401
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Garbage token: 401
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer not.a.token
